<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.card.relights ~ a dark face mints its card again before its bags

`lares vault recard --face N` proves the face's own route on a TTY and hands it to the custody door in a `recard` frame (under a pūlama the route proves at the pūlama's hand door first, and this command asks none). The door refuses any face whose last light did not refuse for want of a prekey secret, then arms its next light: the stand mints its card before its bags. The identity stays; content sealed to a lost prekey stays lost.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ recard

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`recard` params=`face/2 ~ recard face h2`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index needs/required ~ the face, by persona index`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/route ~ a person types the face's route at their own terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-unreachable · recard-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.card.relights face/2]] ~ name the face's handle index`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-unreachable` params=`cure/[[face.card.relights face/2]] ~ no vessel answers its custody door`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`recard-refused` params=`~ the door refused the recard; its reason rides the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ recarded

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`recarded` params=`exit/0 ~ the face's next light stands armed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares vault recard

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares vault recard]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

